Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:56.64,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}そう まるで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:59.48,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}旬を過ぎチカラのように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.53,0:02:02.49,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Rotten to the core deeper また一つ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:06.72,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}でも I have reawakened for revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:10.62,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}このふざけたルールにだって
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:12.47,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}They chew up and spit you out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:14.28,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Statue will leave a body count
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.19,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}青二才の渇望と焦燥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.99,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}闇に滲むあの日の肖像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:19.93,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}I give back the light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:21.93,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}It gimme what I please
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:23.74,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}ギュゲスの指輪を
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:25.94,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Cuz I'm back in this game
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:27.80,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}So let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:31.50,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}与えられたシナリオ以上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.42,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Cuz I'm back in this game
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.26,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}We can survive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:39.03,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}もがき研ぎ澄ました hunter's pride
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.08,0:02:42.58,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}The pain inside us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:43.17,op jp,tag,0,0,18,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Trillion and one G on a bungee all stan
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.91,0:02:45.75,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Should never go away
